OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over Fort Regent private
OL,4,Ainvestment plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former leader of Portsmouth City
OL,7,FCouncil has warned the Government of
OL,8,FJersey to ensure it does not get
OL,9,F"ripped off" by the private sector,
OL,10,Fafter ministers said investors may be
OL,11,Fasked to redevelop Fort Regent.
OL,13,FThe States-owned Jersey Development
OL,14,FCompany has until now been leading the
OL,15,Frenovation project and initial work,
OL,16,Ffunded by a #43m loan, to remove
OL,17,Fasbestos and repair the roof at the
OL,18,Fclosed leisure centre will still go
OL,19,Fahead.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
