OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over Fort Regent private
OL,4,Ainvestment plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut after overall costs rose beyond the
OL,7,F#110m estimate, officials announced
OL,8,Fsubsequent plans to breathe fresh life
OL,9,Finto the site would be re-examined.
OL,11,FThe redevelopment had been forecast for
OL,12,Fcompletion by 2029, but the timeline is
OL,13,Fnow uncertain.
